alternatives: Leaving the full 6.20 mm surface provides larger continuous stock but removes the shallow revealed datum. A 0.24 mm deeper recess is more pronounced on the native layer grid but changes the datum surface/step. A separate writable card provides more room without this recess, but is detached from the moving shutter.
