[sliver] These 0.833 mm wide annular cheek faces are part of the source FH rear-face adapter. The bearing has 5.25 mm vertical stock and a continuous elliptical backing, within Z 6.20–13.25; these are narrow exposed face strips, not an 0.833 mm unsupported wall. Its 1.80 mm existing-passage locator has measured minimum CAD air 0.2015646773 mm, not a uniform per-face clearance. The adapter is storage, not a qualified snap stiffness fixture.
alternatives: Additional outer bearing stock can enlarge the cheeks without changing FH, but enlarges its adapter and needs parking/loading access rechecked. A solid filled support below the rear face closes the passage view and needs the locator/removal envelope reviewed. A separate larger cradle adds a part and changes the support/contact configuration.
file: hardware/printed-parts/calibration/soda-studies/print-assemblies/pip-base.step
